{"id":"n14089-2-7","stage":3,"title":"영역 · 领域","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14089-2-7-1","ko":"민준이는 매일 집하고 학교만 왔다 갔다 해.","zh":"敏俊每天就只是在家和学校之间来回跑而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"매일","meaning":"天天，每日","explanation":"매일：天天，每日","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58104","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집하고","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교만","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔다","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"天天，每日","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58104","definition":"每天都，无遗漏地。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3b4fcbe6c6f73688448.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14089-2-7-2","ko":"그래? 활동 영역이 매우 좁구나.","zh":"是吗？他的活动范围可真窄啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"활동","meaning":"活动","explanation":"활동：活动","readings":[{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74135","senseId":"2","lemma":"활동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영역이","meaning":"领域","explanation":"영역：领域；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영역","audio":"/audio/0e9a97ab6072e39592a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14089","senseId":"2","lemma":"영역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁구나.","meaning":"狭窄，狭隘","explanation":"좁다：狭窄，狭隘；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"4","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"d4b47a5cf76094e9","term":"활동","zh":"活动","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3","entryId":"74135","definition":"为在某事中取得好结果而努力。","pronunciation":["활똥"]},{"id":"0e9a97ab6072e395","term":"영역","zh":"领域","audio":"/audio/0e9a97ab6072e39592a7.mp3","entryId":"14089","definition":"力量、想法、活动等影响的领域或范围。","pronunciation":["영역"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"狭窄，狭隘","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"内容或范围等涉及范围不广。","pronunciation":["좁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4fbcfdc79ccc4a559822.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14089","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.5017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？他的活动范围可真窄啊。","敏俊每天就只是在家和学校之间来回跑而已。","这次节日你打算去外婆家吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊每天就只是在家和学校之间来回跑而已。","这次节日你打算去外婆家吗？","是吗？他的活动范围可真窄啊。"],"answer":2}]}
